
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>燒燙傷醫院緊急導航 — 屏東 / 茂林</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&family=Bebas+Neue&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --red: #C0392B;
    --red-dark: #96281B;
    --red-light: #FDECEA;
    --orange: #E67E22;
    --yellow: #F39C12;
    --navy: #1A2035;
    --navy-mid: #253152;
    --slate: #3D4F6B;
    --muted: #8494A8;
    --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
    --surface: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --off: #F0F3F8;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--white);
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ─── Background pattern ─── */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 80% 20%, rgba(192,57,43,0.18) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 10% 80%, rgba(26,32,53,0.9) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  /* grid lines */
  body::after {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 40px 40px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .page { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1rem 3rem; }

  /* ─── Header ─── */
  header {
    padding: 2.5rem 0 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    animation: fadeDown 0.5s ease both;
  }

  .emergency-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    background: var(--red);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .emergency-badge .dot {
    width: 7px; height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    animation: blink 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .main-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 8vw, 62px);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .main-title span { color: var(--red); }

  .header-meta {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hotline {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: var(--red);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }
  .hotline:hover { background: var(--red-dark); }

  /* ─── Tabs ─── */
  .tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.5s 0.1s ease both;
  }

  .tab-btn {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .tab-btn + .tab-btn { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .tab-btn.active {
    background: var(--red);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .tab-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* ─── Panels ─── */
  .panel { display: none; animation: fadeUp 0.3s ease both; }
  .panel.active { display: block; }

  /* ─── GPS box ─── */
  .gps-box {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .btn-gps {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px;
    background: var(--navy-mid);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-gps:hover { background: var(--slate); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }

  .gps-status {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    min-height: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .gps-status.ok { color: #2ECC71; }
  .gps-status.err { color: var(--red); }

  .spinner {
    width: 14px; height: 14px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    border-top-color: var(--white);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
    display: none;
  }

  /* ─── Select ─── */
  .select-wrap { position: relative; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

  select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px 16px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    cursor: pointer;
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  select:focus { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }

  select option { background: var(--navy-mid); color: var(--white); }

  .select-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    right: 14px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    pointer-events: none;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  /* ─── Hospital cards ─── */
  #hospitals-section { animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease both; }

  .hospitals-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hospitals-heading {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .location-tag {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--orange);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .h-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease both;
  }

  .h-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }

  .h-card.top { border-color: var(--red); border-width: 1.5px; }

  .h-top-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .h-num {
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--navy-mid);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .h-card.top .h-num { background: var(--red); color: #fff; }

  .h-main { flex: 1; }

  .h-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--red);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 2px 9px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .h-name {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .h-meta {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .h-meta strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-weight: 500; }

  .beds-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 10px 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .bed-pill {
    background: var(--navy-mid);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .bed-pill b { color: var(--white); font-size: 15px; margin-right: 3px; }

  .h-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 7px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .action-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }

  .action-btn.call {
    background: var(--red);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .action-btn.call:hover { background: var(--red-dark); }

  .action-btn.map {
    background: var(--navy-mid);
    color: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }
  .action-btn.map:hover { background: var(--slate); }

  .action-btn svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }

  /* ─── Notice ─── */
  .notice {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(192,57,43,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(192,57,43,0.3);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .notice strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); }

  /* ─── Footer ─── */
  footer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ─── Animations ─── */
  @keyframes fadeDown { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(-12px); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
  @keyframes fadeUp   { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(12px);  } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
  @keyframes blink    { 0%,100% { opacity:1; } 50% { opacity:0.3; } }
  @keyframes spin     { to { transform:rotate(360deg); } }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .h-actions { gap: 6px; }
    .action-btn { font-size: 12px; padding: 7px 12px; }
    .beds-row { gap: 7px; }
  }

  /* ─── First Aid Section ─── */
  .first-aid-section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.5s 0.15s ease both;
  }

  .first-aid-section .section-label { margin-bottom: 1rem; }

  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) { .steps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .step-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-num {
    width: 32px; height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--red);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-body { flex: 1; }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .step-icon {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .degree-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) { .degree-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .degree-card {
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .degree-card.d1 {
    background: rgba(243,156,18,0.10);
    border-color: rgba(243,156,18,0.25);
  }
  .degree-card.d2 {
    background: rgba(230,126,34,0.12);
    border-color: rgba(230,126,34,0.28);
  }
  .degree-card.d3 {
    background: rgba(192,57,43,0.13);
    border-color: rgba(192,57,43,0.32);
  }

  .degree-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .d1 .degree-label { color: var(--yellow); }
  .d2 .degree-label { color: var(--orange); }
  .d3 .degree-label { color: #E74C3C; }

  .degree-name {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .degree-desc {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .donot-box {
    background: rgba(192,57,43,0.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(192,57,43,0.28);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .donot-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #E74C3C;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .donot-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 5px 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) { .donot-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .donot-list li {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    padding-left: 14px;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .donot-list li::before {
    content: '✕';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #E74C3C;
    font-size: 10px;
    top: 2px;
  }

  .subsection-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <!-- Header -->
  <header>
    <div class="emergency-badge">
      <div class="dot"></div>
      緊急救護系統
    </div>
    <div class="main-title">燒燙傷<span>醫院</span><br>緊急導航</div>
    <div class="header-meta">
      台灣電力公司電弧灼傷緊急救護聯絡體系<br>
      適用範圍：屏東縣各鄉鎮 ／ 高雄市茂林區<br>
      資料更新：中華民國115年01月02日
    </div>
    <a class="hotline" href="tel:119">
      <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 10.8 19.79 19.79 0 01.01 2.2 2 2 0 012 .02h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 7.91A16 16 0 0016 16.94l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
      緊急撥打 119
    </a>
  </header>

  <!-- Tabs -->
  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('gps')">
      <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v3m0 14v3M2 12h3m14 0h3"/></svg>
      自動 GPS 定位
    </button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('manual')">
      <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7"/></svg>
      手動選擇鄉鎮
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- GPS Panel -->
  <div id="panel-gps" class="panel active">
    <div class="gps-box">
      <div class="section-label">手機 GPS 自動定位</div>
      <button class="btn-gps" onclick="getLocation()">
        <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v3m0 14v3M2 12h3m14 0h3"/></svg>
        取得目前所在位置
      </button>
      <div class="gps-status" id="gps-status">
        <span id="gps-spinner" class="spinner"></span>
        <span id="gps-msg">點擊按鈕，系統將要求定位權限</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Manual Panel -->
  <div id="panel-manual" class="panel">
    <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:8px;">選擇所在鄉鎮市區</div>
    <div class="select-wrap">
      <select id="township-select" onchange="onTownshipChange()">
        <option value="">— 請選擇鄉鎮市區 —</option>
        <optgroup label="高雄市">
          <option value="茂林區">茂林區</option>
        </optgroup>
        <optgroup label="屏東縣">
          <option value="屏東市">屏東市</option>
          <option value="潮州鎮">潮州鎮</option>
          <option value="東港鎮">東港鎮</option>
          <option value="恆春鎮">恆春鎮</option>
          <option value="萬丹鄉">萬丹鄉</option>
          <option value="長治鄉">長治鄉</option>
          <option value="麟洛鄉">麟洛鄉</option>
          <option value="九如鄉">九如鄉</option>
          <option value="里港鄉">里港鄉</option>
          <option value="鹽埔鄉">鹽埔鄉</option>
          <option value="高樹鄉">高樹鄉</option>
          <option value="萬巒鄉">萬巒鄉</option>
          <option value="內埔鄉">內埔鄉</option>
          <option value="竹田鄉">竹田鄉</option>
          <option value="新埤鄉">新埤鄉</option>
          <option value="枋寮鄉">枋寮鄉</option>
          <option value="新園鄉">新園鄉</option>
          <option value="崁頂鄉">崁頂鄉</option>
          <option value="林邊鄉">林邊鄉</option>
          <option value="南州鄉">南州鄉</option>
          <option value="佳冬鄉">佳冬鄉</option>
          <option value="琉球鄉">琉球鄉</option>
          <option value="車城鄉">車城鄉</option>
          <option value="滿州鄉">滿州鄉</option>
          <option value="枋山鄉">枋山鄉</option>
          <option value="三地門鄉">三地門鄉</option>
          <option value="霧台鄉">霧台鄉</option>
          <option value="瑪家鄉">瑪家鄉</option>
          <option value="泰武鄉">泰武鄉</option>
          <option value="來義鄉">來義鄉</option>
          <option value="春日鄉">春日鄉</option>
          <option value="獅子鄉">獅子鄉</option>
          <option value="牡丹鄉">牡丹鄉</option>
        </optgroup>
      </select>
      <span class="select-arrow">▼</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hospitals Section -->
  <div id="hospitals-section" style="display:none;">
    <div class="hospitals-header">
      <div class="hospitals-heading">建議就醫醫院（依優先順序）</div>
      <div class="location-tag" id="location-tag"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="hospital-list"></div>

    <div class="notice">
      ⚠️ <strong>緊急情況請先撥打 119。</strong><br>
      各醫院燒燙傷病床數依需求隨時調動，<strong>實際床位請事先電話確認</strong>。<br>
      建議二度灼傷面積達 <strong>15%</strong> 或三度灼傷面積達 <strong>10%</strong> 以上之傷患需住加護病床。
    </div>
