    <div class="degree-grid">
      <div class="degree-card d1">
        <div class="degree-label">一度</div>
        <div class="degree-name">表淺燒傷</div>
        <div class="degree-desc">僅傷及表皮<br>紅腫、疼痛、無水泡<br>約 3–5 天癒合</div>
      </div>
      <div class="degree-card d2">
        <div class="degree-label">二度</div>
        <div class="degree-name">真皮燒傷</div>
        <div class="degree-desc">傷及真皮層<br>紅腫、水泡、劇痛<br>面積≥15% 需加護</div>
      </div>
      <div class="degree-card d3">
        <div class="degree-label">三度</div>
        <div class="degree-name">全層燒傷</div>
        <div class="degree-desc">傷及皮下組織<br>焦黑、不痛（神經壞死）<br>面積≥10% 需加護</div>
